# EVB

Read `AGENTS.md`, `docs/product.md`, `docs/architecture.md`, and the current step in `docs/implementation-plan.md` before writing code.

- Implement one plan step at a time. The app is not built yet.
- Google-only auth. Session required on data routes.
- Tag catalog, weather derivation, ranking, filters, and status transitions live in `packages/domain`.
- Clients display status. Only the worker or admin review may set `ready`, `pending_review`, or `rejected`.
- Discover returns rows with `visibility = public` and `status = ready`.
- Keep upload progress and non-terminal outfits visible in the upload tray.

```ts
// BAD — UI decides that moderation passed
await api.patchOutfit(id, { status: "ready" });

// GOOD — UI asks for the server status and renders it
const outfit = await api.getOutfit(id);
return <StatusChip status={outfit.status} progress={uploadProgress} />;
```
